      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "PROBLEM",
      "narration_text": "Start with the problem. Writing is a shorthand for speech. The same letters can sound different: red and reed. The same abbreviation can mean two things: doctor and drive. And numbers aren't words at all until something decides how to say them.",
