      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "FRAMEWORK",
      "narration_text": "Most text-to-speech systems follow four steps. Clean up: spell out numbers and abbreviations. Sound it out: turn each word into phonemes, the small sounds speech is made of. Plan the delivery: how long, how high and how loud each sound should be. Then build the wave.",
